# Pairs with ListedInSink. A delete whose lease ran out ends while a
# republish holds the id between its manifest and its row, sees no row, and
# deletes the manifest the republish is about to register.
MODULE: ListedInSinkEndIgnoresPublish
TARGET: ListedInSink
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a delete ends without waiting for a publish of the id
PERTURBS: DelEnd

--- FIND
DelEnd(d) ==
    /\ del[d] = "art"
    /\ held["A"] = "free"
--- REPLACE
DelEnd(d) ==
    /\ del[d] = "art"
    \* MUTATION: the end does not take the hold.
--- END
